# Retained internal source references are not part of the runnable demo or a
# running server. The original backend source is now intentionally visible
# to the source-review allowlist, but its startup guard remains in place.
# Real host launchers remain private references. The generic public wrappers
# call a fail-closed adapter and cannot install or start the guarded backend.
SOURCE-MANIFEST.json
app/host-reference/
app/public/assets/
app/vendor/erp-glb-viewer-source/dist/
